mn77:6.14 starts: There is also this recluse Gotama, the head of an order
mn77:6.51 none
mn77:6.54 starts: Indeed, he is scorned by the scorn shown to his Dhamma.’
mn77:6.59 starts: and there a certain disciple of his cleared his throat.
mn77:8.1 starts: “Venerable sir, I see five qualities in the Blessed One because of which
